<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1726897244"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:48.033"><div begin="26.280" end="49.374" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="26.280" end="30.882" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.280" end="26.766">我们都</span><span begin="26.766" end="27.609">曾有</span><span begin="27.609" end="28.090">过</span> <span begin="28.090" end="28.573">风雨</span><span begin="28.573" end="28.954">过</span><span begin="28.954" end="29.501">后的</span><span begin="29.501" end="30.041">沉</span><span begin="30.041" end="30.882">重</span></p><p begin="31.280" end="37.149" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.280" end="31.747">形同</span><span begin="31.747" end="32.280">陌路的</span><span begin="32.280" end="32.864">口</span> <span begin="33.006" end="33.237">但</span><span begin="33.237" end="34.429">心却还</span><span begin="34.429" end="34.661">流</span><span begin="34.661" end="37.149">通</span></p><p begin="38.530" end="43.553" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.530" end="39.236">当我们一</span><span begin="39.236" end="40.025">起走</span><span begin="40.025" end="40.591">过</span> <span begin="40.591" end="41.041">这些</span><span begin="41.041" end="41.457">伤</span><span begin="41.457" end="42.029">痛的</span><span begin="42.029" end="42.530">时</span><span begin="42.530" end="43.553">候</span></p><p begin="43.781" end="49.374" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.781" end="44.139">包着</span><span begin="44.139" end="44.704">碎裂的</span><span begin="44.704" end="45.287">心</span> <span begin="45.471" end="45.711">继</span><span begin="45.711" end="46.912">续下一</span><span begin="46.912" end="47.128">个</span><span begin="47.128" end="49.374">梦</span></p></div><div begin="49.589" end="1:15.620" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="49.589" end="55.510" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.589" end="49.979">也</span><span begin="49.979" end="50.227">知</span><span begin="50.227" end="51.234">道</span> <span begin="51.512" end="51.896">我们</span><spa